    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d106">

                <pb facs="0191" n="171" xml:id="pg171"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    IO Files: US/S/311, also US/SEC/64</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation by the Acting Deputy
                        Secretary-General of the United States Mission at the United Nations</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Power</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New
                                York</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1948-03-17"
                            >March 17, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <table>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#nowrap">Participants:</cell>
                        <cell>Dr. Hanna Saba, United Nations<anchor n="1" xml:id="d106-f1"/>
                        </cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>Mr. T. F. Power, Jr., United States Mission</cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <p>Dr. Saba informed me this morning that the United Nations today received a
                    telegram signed by Acting Foreign Minister Clementis accrediting Mr. Houdek as
                    Permanent Czechoslovakian Delegate to the United Nations, empowered to sit on
                    all United Nations bodies on which Czechoslovakia is entitled to be
                    represented.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d106-f1" n="1" xml:id="d106-f1-content">
                <p>Director of Division of Privileges and Immunities and Registration of
                    Treaties.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
